      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Training jobs → model registry → managed batch scoring\nDataset / feature / calibration / model versions; as-of cutoff\nCrop rating + quality + uncertainty / UNKNOWN → registered result\nOptional online endpoint / separate drone vision batch model\nSentinel feature classifier is not a raw-drone image classifier",
